                                          3895  #     $20 JSR $DDDD     but gets mapped to #$DD      handled in v6502_mode0 and v6502_JSR
                                          3896  #     $40 RTI -         but gets mapped to #$DD      handled in v6502_mode0
                                          3897  #     $60 RTS -         but gets mapped to #$DD      handled in v6502_mode0
                                          3898  #     $6C JMP ($DDDD)   but gets mapped to $DDDD     handled in v6502_JMP2
                                          3899  #     $96 STX $DD,Y     but gets mapped to $DD,X     handled in v6502_STX2
